<title>UK: CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>CHELMSFORD, England 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essex beat Glamorgan</p>
<p>by one wicket in their NatWest Trophy semifinal match which was</p>
<p>completed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Glamorgan 301-8 innings closed (60 overs), Essex</p>
<p>303-9 in 55 overs (S.Thomas 5-74).</p>
<p>The second semifinal between Warwickshire and Sussex at</p>
<p>Edgbaston began at 1000 GMT.</p>
</text>
